OL,3,GNEWSAThree taken to hospital following
OL,4,Asix-vehicle crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree men have been taken to hospital
OL,7,Ffollowing a six-vehicle crash which
OL,8,Fclosed the motorway.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to
OL,11,Freports of a multi-vehicle crash near
OL,12,Fjunction seven of the M5 southbound, in
OL,13,FWorcester, at about 07:40 BST on
OL,14,FMonday.
OL,16,FTwo men were treated for potentially
OL,17,Fserious injuries at the scene before
OL,18,Fbeing taken to Worcestershire Royal
OL,19,FHospital, West Midlands Ambulance
OL,20,FService (WMAS) said.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
